{"kind":"artifact","text":"Companion for #11763 at internal/kernel, same exact head 52a8e7cba851d4e30df5f127ad382381ce96fcb4 on request/write-boundary-guards. Generic post-dedup application callback added to the sequencing path via Options.PostDedup/Application: the kernel schedules it but carries no Workroom semantics; replay is recognized before the hook, changed-intent stays a conflict, a refusal leaves the log untouched, and CAS loss reevaluates against the new head. Tests cover hook ordering and all four behaviors; no schema or fold-profile bump.","body":{"commit":"52a8e7cba851d4e30df5f127ad382381ce96fcb4"}}